  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.2', 'UK Cities', 'What is affordable housing?', 'Housing sold or rented below market price for people on low incomes.', 24),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.2', 'UK Cities', 'What is sustainable transport in UK cities?', 'Buses, trams, cycling schemes and electric vehicle charging points.', 25),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.2', 'UK Cities', 'What is ethnic diversity in UK cities?', 'Cities like London and Birmingham have diverse populations from many backgrounds.', 26),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.2', 'UK Cities', 'What is the impact of international migration on UK cities?', 'Population growth, cultural diversity and a larger workforce, but pressure on services.', 27),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.2', 'UK Cities', 'What is a Local Development Plan?', 'A council''s plan for how land will be used and developed in its area.', 28),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.2', 'UK Cities', 'What is urban greening?', 'Adding green spaces, trees and parks to cities to improve the environment.', 29),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.2', 'UK Cities', 'What is a sustainable community?', 'A place with good housing, jobs, transport, services and environment for current and future residents.', 30),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is development?', 'The process of improving people''s standard of living and quality of life.', 1),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is GNI per capita?', 'Gross national income divided by the population, a measure of average wealth.', 2),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is the Human Development Index?', 'A measure of development combining life expectancy, education and income.', 3),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is life expectancy?', 'The average number of years a person is expected to live.', 4),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is literacy rate?', 'The percentage of adults who can read and write.', 5),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is infant mortality rate?', 'The number of babies who die before their first birthday per 1000 live births.', 6),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is a high-income country (HIC)?', 'A wealthy, developed country, e.g. the UK or USA.', 7),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is a low-income country (LIC)?', 'A poorer country with lower development, e.g. Malawi.', 8),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is a newly emerging economy (NEE)?', 'A country experiencing rapid economic growth, e.g. India or Brazil.', 9),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is the development gap?', 'The difference in wealth and quality of life between richer and poorer countries.', 10),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What are the causes of uneven development?', 'Physical factors (climate, disasters), economic factors (trade, debt) and historical factors (colonialism).', 11),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'How does trade affect development?', 'Countries exporting low-value primary products earn less than those exporting manufactured goods.', 12),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is aid?', 'Help given by one country or organisation to another, e.g. money, food or expertise.', 13),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is short-term aid?', 'Emergency help after a disaster, e.g. food, shelter and medicine.', 14),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is long-term aid?', 'Help to improve development over time, e.g. building schools and wells.', 15),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is fair trade?', 'A system ensuring producers in poorer countries receive a fair price and good working conditions.', 16),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is debt relief?', 'Cancelling some of a country''s debt so it can spend more on development.', 17),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.3', 'Global Development', 'What is microfinance?', 'Small loans to people in poorer countries to start businesses.', 18),
