  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is climate change?', 'A long-term change in the Earth''s climate, including temperature and rainfall patterns.', 1),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is the greenhouse effect?', 'Gases in the atmosphere trap heat from the Sun, keeping the Earth warm.', 2),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is the enhanced greenhouse effect?', 'Human activities increase greenhouse gases, trapping more heat and causing global warming.', 3),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'Name three greenhouse gases.', 'Carbon dioxide, methane and nitrous oxide.', 4),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What are the human causes of climate change?', 'Burning fossil fuels, deforestation, farming (methane from cattle), and industry.', 5),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What are the natural causes of climate change?', 'Changes in the Earth''s orbit, volcanic eruptions and variations in solar output.', 6),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is the evidence for climate change?', 'Rising global temperatures, melting ice caps, rising sea levels, and ice core records.', 7),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What do ice cores show?', 'Air bubbles trapped in ice show past levels of CO₂ and temperature.', 8),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What are the effects of climate change on the environment?', 'Rising sea levels, melting ice, more extreme weather, and loss of habitats.', 9),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What are the effects of climate change on people?', 'Flooding, food shortages, water shortages, and health problems.', 10),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is mitigation?', 'Reducing the causes of climate change, e.g. cutting emissions.', 11),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is adaptation?', 'Changing how we live to cope with the effects of climate change.', 12),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'Give examples of mitigation.', 'Renewable energy, planting trees, carbon capture, and international agreements.', 13),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'Give examples of adaptation.', 'Flood defences, drought-resistant crops, and changing farming practices.', 14),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is carbon capture and storage?', 'Capturing CO₂ from power stations and storing it underground.', 15),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is the Paris Agreement?', 'A 2015 international agreement to limit global warming to well below 2 °C.', 16),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is a carbon footprint?', 'The total amount of greenhouse gases produced by a person, organisation or activity.', 17),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'How can individuals reduce their carbon footprint?', 'Using public transport, saving energy, recycling, and eating less meat.', 18),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'How does climate change affect the UK?', 'Hotter summers, wetter winters, more flooding and rising sea levels.', 19),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'How does climate change affect poorer countries?', 'They are often more vulnerable to droughts, floods and storms, with fewer resources to adapt.', 20),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is sea-level rise caused by?', 'Melting ice sheets and glaciers, and thermal expansion of water.', 21),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is thermal expansion?', 'Water expanding as it warms, raising sea levels.', 22),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is the Quaternary period?', 'The last 2.6 million years, with glacial and interglacial periods.', 23),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is an interglacial period?', 'A warmer period between glacial periods.', 24),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'How does deforestation contribute to climate change?', 'Trees absorb CO₂; removing them increases CO₂ in the atmosphere.', 25),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is the role of methane in climate change?', 'Methane is a powerful greenhouse gas released by cattle, rice farming and landfill.', 26),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is renewable energy?', 'Energy from sources that won''t run out, e.g. wind, solar and hydroelectric power.', 27),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is a climate refugee?', 'Someone forced to move because of the effects of climate change.', 28),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'How do rising temperatures affect ecosystems?', 'Species may move, adapt or become extinct, e.g. coral bleaching.', 29),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.2', 'Climate Change', 'What is coral bleaching?', 'Corals expel algae when water is too warm, turning white and possibly dying.', 30),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.3', 'Water Management', 'What is water security?', 'Having reliable access to enough safe, clean water.', 1),
