  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '1.1', 'Landscape Systems', 'What is positive feedback in a landscape system?', 'A process that amplifies change, e.g. glacier retreat exposes darker ground, which absorbs more heat and accelerates melting.', 3),
