  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '2.2', 'Trade in the Contemporary World', 'What are the problems of relying on primary product exports?', 'Price volatility, low value added, and declining terms of trade.', 7),
  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '2.2', 'Trade in the Contemporary World', 'What is value added?', 'The increase in value from processing or manufacturing a raw material into a finished product.', 8),
  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '2.2', 'Trade in the Contemporary World', 'What is the role of trade in development?', 'Trade can generate income, jobs and investment, but may also increase dependency and inequality.', 9),
  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '2.2', 'Trade in the Contemporary World', 'What is ethical trading?', 'Trading in a way that ensures fair wages, safe working conditions and environmental protection.', 10),
  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '2.3', 'Global Migration', 'What is net migration?', 'The difference between immigration and emigration.', 1),
  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '2.3', 'Global Migration', 'What is an economic migrant?', 'A person who moves to another country to improve their standard of living, usually for work.', 2),
  ('Geography', 'OCR', 'alevel', '2.3', 'Global Migration', 'What is Lee''s migration model?', 'A model of migration based on push factors, pull factors, intervening obstacles and personal factors.', 3),
