  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What is mutualism?', 'Proudhon''s idea of a society based on voluntary exchange and cooperative banks.', 15),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What is the anarchist critique of religion?', 'Religion is a form of authority that suppresses individual freedom.', 16),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What is the anarchist critique of capitalism?', 'Collectivists argue capitalism exploits workers and relies on the state to protect property.', 17),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What is the anarchist view of liberty?', 'True freedom is only possible without the state.', 18),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What is propaganda by the deed?', 'The use of violent acts to inspire revolution, used by some anarchists in the late 19th century.', 19),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What is the anarchist view of democracy?', 'Representative democracy is a form of domination; anarchists favour direct democracy or none.', 20),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What are the criticisms of anarchism?', 'It is utopian, unrealistic about human nature, and could lead to chaos.', 21),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.5', 'Anarchism', 'What is the anarchist view of economic freedom?', 'Collectivists see economic freedom as freedom from exploitation; individualists as freedom of exchange.', 22),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is ecologism?', 'An ideology that places the natural environment at the centre of political thinking.', 1),
