  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is environmental ethics?', 'The idea that moral consideration should extend to future generations, animals and nature.', 5),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is ecological consciousness?', 'A deep awareness of humanity''s connection to nature.', 6),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is Lovelock''s Gaia hypothesis?', 'The Earth is a self-regulating living system.', 7),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is Carson''s contribution to ecologism?', 'Silent Spring (1962) exposed the damage caused by pesticides, starting the modern environmental movement.', 8),
