  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is eco-socialism?', 'The view that capitalism causes environmental destruction, so common ownership is needed.', 11),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is eco-anarchism?', 'The belief that small, decentralised communities living in harmony with nature are ideal.', 12),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is eco-feminism?', 'The view that patriarchy and environmental destruction are linked.', 13),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is the ecologist view of the economy?', 'Opposition to endless growth; support for a steady-state or zero-growth economy.', 14),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is the ecologist view of the state?', 'Shallow greens accept the state; deep greens favour decentralised communities.', 15),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is anthropocentrism?', 'A human-centred view that nature exists for human use.', 16),
