  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What are the criticisms of ecologism?', 'It may be anti-growth and anti-development, and deep ecology is seen as impractical.', 21),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.6', 'Ecologism', 'What is green consumerism?', 'Buying environmentally friendly products, criticised by deep ecologists for not tackling underlying problems.', 22),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.7', 'Feminism', 'What is liberal feminism?', 'Feminism seeking legal and political equality for women within the existing system through reform.', 1),
