  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.7', 'Feminism', 'What is Millett''s contribution to feminism?', 'Sexual Politics (1970) argued patriarchy operates through all social institutions, especially the family.', 11),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.7', 'Feminism', 'What is Rowbotham''s contribution to feminism?', 'A socialist feminist who argued women''s oppression is linked to capitalism and class.', 12),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.7', 'Feminism', 'What is the feminist view of human nature?', 'Equality feminists argue gender is socially constructed; difference feminists see natural differences.', 13),
  ('Politics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '2.7', 'Feminism', 'What is the feminist view of the state?', 'Liberal feminists see the state as a tool for reform; radical feminists see it as patriarchal.', 14),
